This license covers the code and documentation in this repository.

It does not cover the training corpora, which are not redistributed here and
remain under their own terms:

  Tiny Shakespeare        via karpathy/char-rnn — see smLLM_01/README.md
  TinyStories             a pinned prefix — see smLANGUAGE_EN_001/README.md

smSOFTWARE_ENGINEERING_001 trains on source from 75 permissively licensed
repositories (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD-3-Clause). Their pinned commits, license
identifiers and upstream license texts are recorded in
archive/models/smSOFTWARE_ENGINEERING_001/data/raw/manifest.json and the licenses/ directory
beside it.
